      "source": "This method is invoked only if <a href=\"../MethodMatcher.html#matches(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class)\"><code>MethodMatcher.matches(Method, Class)</code></a> returns\n<code>true</code> for the given method and target class, and if\n<a href=\"../MethodMatcher.html#isRuntime()\"><code>MethodMatcher.isRuntime()</code></a> returns <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "此方法仅在 `<a href=\"../MethodMatcher.html#matches(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class)\"><code>MethodMatcher.matches(Method, Class)</code></a>` 对给定方法和目标类返回`<code>true</code>`，且`<a href=\"../MethodMatcher.html#isRuntime()\"><code>MethodMatcher.isRuntime()</code></a>` 返回 `<code>true</code>` 时被调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Can be invoked when an AOP proxy is created, and need not be invoked\nagain before each method invocation.",
      "translation": "可在创建 AOP 代理时调用，无需在每次方法调用前再次调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked immediately before potential running of the advice, after any\nadvice earlier in the advice chain has run.",
      "translation": "在潜在运行建议之前立即调用，且在建议链中任何较早的建议运行之后。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Is this <code>MethodMatcher</code> dynamic, that is, must a final check be made\nvia the <a href=\"../MethodMatcher.html#matches(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class,java.lang.Object...)\"><code>MethodMatcher.matches(Method, Class, Object[])</code></a> method at runtime even\nif <a href=\"../MethodMatcher.html#matches(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class)\"><code>MethodMatcher.matches(Method, Class)</code></a> returns <code>true</code>?",
      "translation": "这个 `<code>MethodMatcher</code>` 是动态的吗？也就是说，即使 `<a href=\"../MethodMatcher.html#matches(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class)\"><code>MethodMatcher.matches(Method, Class)</code></a>` 返回了 `<code>true</code>`，是否仍然需要在运行时通过 `<a href=\"../MethodMatcher.html#matches(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class,java.lang.Object...)\"><code>MethodMatcher.matches(Method, Class, Object[])</code></a>` 方法进行最终检查？",
      "count": 1
    },
